# A    grey          Olorin, the Wise Dreamer
# A    ***           Salmar, Horn-Maker


N:401:Melkor, Rightful Lord of Arda
W:40:0
G:V:w
F:UNIQUE | MALE
D:Clothed in shining white, he appears as a beacon of
D: hope and strength in this fallen world.

