# File: flvr-tiles.prf

#
# This file defines tile mappings for flavored objects/items for when graphics
# mode is enabled and tiles graphics with the MicroChasm tileset are used.
#
# Tile mappings assign game entities such as rings to tiles in the MicroChasm
# tileset image. For legacy reasons, these tile mappings are expressed as
# attr/char mappings, which are interpreted as an index into the tileset image
# (attr = y = row, char = x = column).
#
# The easiest way to understand and work with these tile mappings is
# using `lib/xtra/graf/TilePicker.html` to visually explore the tileset.
#
#
# === Understanding flvr-tiles.prf ===
#
# L: flavor index : attr/char
#
# 'L' is for flavored objects. The flavor index ('L:<idx>') corresponds to the
#     the serial number ('N:' line) in `lib/edit/flavor.txt`.
#     The attr/char value is a hex pair (e.g., 0x82/0x80) representing the
#     tile position in the tileset image (attr = row, char = column).
#

###############################################################################
