# This file is included by the X11 port (when the game was compiled via
# `src/main-x11.c`) to specify various "user preferences", including "macros".
#
# Notes:
# - Uses `\a` (bell) to allow the macros to stop if the game is not yet ready
#   for a command.
# - Uses `\\.` (for "run") and `\\+` (for "alter") to make sure that the macros
#   will work regardless of the "keymap" being used.
